", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974685_1840524873122821_3055739933188055904_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Uba34K6KuSgQ7kNvwHrcWAf&_nc_oc=AdqWorJib9opkfrTEwpUlJwwkLykxlTuz86XO5aLdhGW5giTieVOpOkcIOGQj91zhQs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7sFxv67alMaaqaaKwIuO4dZeF93CDd2FiYAKNZZoGUUg&oe=6A12FF79"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "3474397939524850", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974494_3474397942858183_7325370313459975246_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dkCrGgd1ZUsQ7kNvwHMxGRe&_nc_oc=Adot8BqPZklLOY2AsS4oFcbmypJIydarFNvmvzzSXGJ7CozwvaB5RPmXTXTZynVibp4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af75QPr13JOEQ-K5brMDtoWP-SCPfwpDJhYJ0wZMRm9Pig&oe=6A13164B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Hard Drive Logo (6).png", "id": "1060475455596738", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984476_1060475458930071_8663595066419356644_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xIUa5Xhs9zUQ7kNvwGA2PNE&_nc_oc=Adrvxhpgu8ltMd7lVkg0rw2jvIBfuKLJp4ak-0yYk9RAOTQLDcp_qmgxh7WWLYhcEqA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4_Wiz4gBfyEipW6JNu-ZQGc1VvHh1p_JZoRwGpHoJQBw&oe=6A1314CE"}, "display_name": "Hard Drive", "keywords": [], "long_description": "# *Hard Drive* \n\nHard Drive is a fast-paced, multiplayer, competitive electro combat driving game. Players control sleek, neon-lit motorcycle looking vehicles, known as bykes, which leave behind a temporary solid trail of light as they move. Players must outmaneuver their opponents by creating a trails of light that they cannot avoid crashing into, while avoiding the trails left by other players.\n\n# _Current Features_\n- Non PvP Driving Park\n- 6 Player Combat Arena\n- Season Pass with Progression Rewards\n- Cosmetic Shop \n\n## More Coming Soon. . .", "short_description": "Electro Combat Driving "}]}, "devel